{
  "sample": {
    "sample_id": "helpsteer3:train:2f3c8ad3347a25a52f5f15a9a66aa5e2d68d793b71bdae1bb8df0f44434cc4a2",
    "task": "Come up with an End of Evangelion scene in which Asuka doesn't get killed by the EVAs and Shinji arrives to help her",
    "chosen": "In the heart-pounding climax of End of Evangelion, Asuka, piloting the Eva Unit-02, finds herself overwhelmed by the relentless assault of the Mass Production Evangelions. Despite her formidable skills and determination, she's pushed to the brink, her Eva severely damaged. Just as it seems that all hope is lost, a sudden burst of light illuminates the battlefield.\n\nShinji, having finally mustered the courage to face his fears and take action, arrives in the Eva Unit-01. His eyes are filled with determination and a newfound sense of purpose. He sees Asuka's plight and immediately rushes to her aid, his Eva moving with a grace and power that surprises even him.\n\nAsuka, her vision blurred by the damage to her Eva, hears the familiar hum of Unit-01's engines and feels a surge of hope. She looks up to see Shinji's Eva standing protectively in front of her, its A.T. Field glowing with a brilliant, fiery aura. The Mass Production Evangelions hesitate, their coordinated attack disrupted by this unexpected turn of events.\n\nShinji, his voice filled with conviction, speaks to Asuka through their mental link, \"Asuka, I'm here. I won't let them hurt you anymore.\" Asuka, her heart pounding, responds with a weak but resolute, \"Took you long enough, idiot.\" Their shared laughter, filled with relief and camaraderie, echoes through the mental link.\n\nTogether, they fight back against the Mass Production Evangelions, their synchronized movements a testament to their newfound trust and understanding. With each strike, they grow stronger, their combined A.T. Fields creating a formidable barrier against their enemies. In the end, they emerge victorious, their bond stronger than ever, and the world around them forever changed by their courage and unity.",
    "rejected": "Title: \"A New Dawn\"\n\n\nINT. EVA UNIT-01 - CONTROL ROOM - NIGHT\n\nShinji Ikari, still in his pilot's suit, is seen monitoring the situation. He notices that Unit-01, piloted by Asuka Langley Soryu, is under heavy attack from an Angel. Shinji's heart races as he realizes the gravity of the situation.\n\nSuddenly, the door slides open, and Shinji rushes in, his eyes wide with concern. He quickly removes his own pilot's suit and approaches Asuka.\n\nASUKA\n(frantically)\nShinji! What are you doing here?\n\nSHINJI\n(calmly)\nI couldn't stay away. I had to help you.\n\nAsuka looks at Shinji, surprised but grateful. She turns her focus back to the Angel, her determination growing.\n\nSuddenly, the Angel's attack becomes more intense. Shinji steps forward, holding out his hand.\n\nSHINJI\n(determined)\nAsuka, grab my hand!\n\nAsuka hesitates for a moment, then takes Shinji's hand. Together, they face the Angel, their combined strength overwhelming it. The Angel is defeated, and Unit-01 emerges victorious.\n\nAsuka and Shinji share a moment of relief, then turn to each other. They look into each other's eyes, understanding growing between them.\n\nASUKA\n(smiling)\nYou really did come.\n\nSHINJI\n(smiling back)\nI couldn't stay away.\n\nThey share a tender moment, their bond strengthened. As they walk out of the control room, they know that they're not alone anymore.\n\nFADE OUT.",
